      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1931, British maker Fairey Aviation established a Belgian subsidiary, Avions Fairey, turning Gosselies into an aeronautical hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
