      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brussels_South_Charleroi_Airport",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "During World War II, the airfield operated as Advanced Landing Ground A‑87 for Allied forces from September 1944 to August 1945.",
